  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting study visit Malaysia for combi-track Food Estates Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Indonesian government is invited to the seminar &quot;Sustainable Horticulture Farming&quot; in Cameron Highlands, Malaysia on 26-27 September 2023. This seminar will discuss how sustainable farming in a greenhouse setting in Cameron Highlands contributes to food security without compromising the environment and affecting human health.After the seminar, Greenheart Farms (led by Dutch expert) will open its doors to the participants who are interested to learn more about their way of sustainable, pesticide-free farming.The participation of the Indonesian government in this seminar will strengthen the bilateral cooperation and there will be follow-up activities such as collaboration and dialog, shared solutions, policy influence, and business leads for the Dutch.</narrative>
  </description>
